      "message": "Discussed in the partner bug:\n- disconnect() APIs will not be opened up as proposed, nor likely at all. This breaks the connection policy abstraction. That abstraction needs work, but its a touchy subject with lots of historical debate internally.\n- HFP HF APis will not be opened up at all. Please use our ConnectionService via a Telecom InCallService to access Bluetooth call control. This will leave you LE Audio ready too. Opening these APIs leaves room for competing control of Bluetooth calls, which risks a stable and robust UX around BT calling.\n- BluetoothClass has alternative APIs for you to get what you need. All bits of the CoD, except the format bits, are available via existing public APIs",
